Enni engineering exercise — terms

This repository is a technical assessment exercise. It is not real Enni product
code and contains no Enni customer data.

- The skeleton in this repository is provided by Enni for the sole purpose of
  this assessment.
- You retain copyright in the code you write as part of your submission.
- By submitting, you grant Enni a non-exclusive licence to review and evaluate
  your submission for this hiring process only. Enni will not use it in any
  product.
- Enni will store your submission securely and delete it within three months.

If anything here is unclear, just ask.
